l' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Accept mail\\nAI: I apologize, but I encountered an issue while trying to send the email. It seems the service is receiving too many requests. Please try again in a moment.\\nHuman: null\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"I'm sorry, I cannot process \\\"null\\\".\\n\\nWe currently have a draft email for Isuru regarding a leave request:\\n\\nSubject: Leave Request\\n\\nRecipient: isuru@csevents.ae\\n\\nPlain-text Preview:\\nDear Isuru,\\n\\nI would like to request a leave of absence. Please specify the dates you wish to request off and the reason for your leave.\\n\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":105,\"promptTokens\":1404,\"totalTokens\":1509}}}"}}
