u,\\n\\nI would like to request a leave of absence. Please specify the dates you wish to request off and the reason for your leave.\\n\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\\nHuman: Expad more\\nAI: Please provide the specific dates you would like to request off and the reason for your leave so I can expand the email content.\\nHuman: Acadamic purpose\"],\"options\":{\"google_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"]},\"base_url\":\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-flash\"},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Subject: Leave Request\\n\\nRecipient: isuru@csevents.ae\\n\\nPlain-text Preview:\\nDear Isuru,\\n\\nI would like to request a leave of absence for academic purposes. Please specify the dates you wish to request off.\\n\\n~DS Automation~\\n\\nPlease review the above email. Type 'accept mail' to send, or reply with changes.\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"STOP\",\"index\":0}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":75,\"promptTokens\":1437,\"totalTokens\":1512}}}"}}
